// The hourly cap. A rule that prints every other cycle makes an event every
// other cycle -- each one a message, since the cycle between is quiet -- and
// the transport sends CSP_SMS_PER_HOUR (20) of them and drops the rest. The
// virtual clock moves a millisecond a cycle, so all of it is one hour.
#param Owners string = "+46701234567"
#variable N = 0
#buffer Sms:160 inout sms Owners
#buffer Rp:160 inout repl
#route Sms Rp
#route Rp Sms
N = N + 1
println("tick ", N) ? (N % 2) == 0
